WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.080
Hey, so I'm Ilo.

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:04.320
I'm the creative director at Veltra Studio.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.570
We're a design agency and we use these

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:08.880
guys for all our white label work.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.130
And look, I've worked with a lot of teams

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:12.240
over the years, okay?

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.360
A lot.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.760
And the difference here is the quality,

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.800
the communication, it's just excellent.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.670
Like genuinely professional, every single

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:22.240
time.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:24.820
Honestly, it feels like having an in-house

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:26.700
team without actually having one, you

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:27.280
know?

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:30.890
No hiring, no managing, no overhead, none

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:31.760
of that.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:32.960
And the best part?

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.960
I don't even think about the work anymore.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:37.840
Like, I hand it over, it just gets done.

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:41.040
Comes back on time and I've had, honestly,

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.480
zero issues.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.060
So yeah, for us, it's just one less thing

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:45.920
to worry about.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:48.080
And in this business, that's everything.
